{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > The hive is <strong>angry</strong>. They have <i>claimed</i> this planet. <i>Today, today, today</i>, they whisper to their brothers, to their sisters. The swarm <i>shivers</i> in anticipation. They click, they chitter, they <strong>burst</strong>. <i>Today, today, today</i>. They move as a river, a steady stream, towards the camp of the walking machines. In unison they chant: <strong>we kill, we kill, we kill</strong>. <br><br>Will you stop them? </p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3052730/extras/12bc66430051cbec07afe512a4d46c81.avif?t=1755840284\" width=614 height=60 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3052730/extras/9ed48293bd02ba97a6335c807b5860bf.poster.avif?t=1755840284\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3052730/extras/9ed48293bd02ba97a6335c807b5860bf.webm?t=1755840284\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3052730/extras/9ed48293bd02ba97a6335c807b5860bf.mp4?t=1755840284\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Managing your settlement is <i>crucial</i> in <strong>Here Comes The Swarm</strong>. Gather enough resources for upgrades and expansion while keeping your population <i>fed and happy</i>. Make sure your defenses are <strong>ready</strong> when <strong>the swarm</strong> comes. </p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3052730/extras/31f6cbb1c68fbd38eacd3b5b0a700073.avif?t=1755840284\" width=614 height=60 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3052730/extras/60b5d69408129c9acef4a2965006f5f2.poster.avif?t=1755840284\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3052730/extras/60b5d69408129c9acef4a2965006f5f2.webm?t=1755840284\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3052730/extras/60b5d69408129c9acef4a2965006f5f2.mp4?t=1755840284\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build the army <i>you</i> want, and train your units to ready them for the hive's <strong>strongest enemies</strong>. Strength comes in numbers for <strong>the swarm</strong>, and their onslaught will be <strong>unrelenting</strong>. Get ready to find <i>thousands</i> of fiends trying to breach your walls. </p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3052730/extras/553623a4c854a5ef01434bec278fb079.avif?t=1755840284\" width=614 height=60 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3052730/extras/e35369f5ba393c1eb16c0f0b618779f4.poster.avif?t=1755840284\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3052730/extras/e35369f5ba393c1eb16c0f0b618779f4.webm?t=1755840284\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3052730/extras/e35369f5ba393c1eb16c0f0b618779f4.mp4?t=1755840284\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose between various <strong>deities</strong> and their <i>divine powers</i> to help you on your journey. Their blessings may very well be the difference between <strong>survival and defeat</strong>. Will you focus on attack, defense, or something <i>completely different</i>? </p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3052730/extras/8d3aa1b903ed1ba4f49fcbea868dd728.avif?t=1755840284\" width=614 height=60 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3052730/extras/99593518b1718ae5929bd88a614e16ad.poster.avif?t=1755840284\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3052730/extras/99593518b1718ae5929bd88a614e16ad.webm?t=1755840284\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3052730/extras/99593518b1718ae5929bd88a614e16ad.mp4?t=1755840284\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find <strong>Arcane essences</strong> on your <strong>skirmishes</strong> to upgrade your <strong>Arcanum</strong>, unlocking new, <strong>powerful nodes</strong> that will <i>change the game</i>. Choose between these new boons to further <i>tailor the game</i> to your own preference. </p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3052730/extras/714307a84736a6fecb4913f1fbda3e0b.avif?t=1755840284\" width=614 height=60 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3052730/extras/8f0bf23ad215cbb6e2fd86f7a0e339ca.poster.avif?t=1755840284\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3052730/extras/8f0bf23ad215cbb6e2fd86f7a0e339ca.webm?t=1755840284\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3052730/extras/8f0bf23ad215cbb6e2fd86f7a0e339ca.mp4?t=1755840284\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter the <strong>expedition</strong> map for a <i>whole new adventure</i>. No play session will be the same as you encounter <strong>new blessings</strong> and <strong>empowered enemies</strong>. With every new step, your adventure will be <i>further shaped</i> by your decisions. </p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3052730/extras/e679b2b23f89ad92d09e08cc81f925be.avif?t=1755840284\" width=614 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't let time be your enemy; make <i>tactical decisions</i> by <strong>pausing</strong> the game during critical moments. You can plan the building of your base, assign army movement, or use it to make yourself a hot drink: you deserve it. </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3052730?t=1755840284","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3052730/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1755840284","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3052730/9a844490e870ddb7731bf4e94de21e09decacb7c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755840284","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3052730/9a844490e870ddb7731bf4e94de21e09decacb7c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755840284","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Our game features frequent combat against alien creatures known as the Swarm, as well as the possibility of human characters being killed by these creatures. Players may encounter visual depictions of blood, dismemberment, and decaying corpses for both humans and aliens, contributing to the game's intense and mature atmosphere."},"demos":[{"appid":3682340,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > The hive is <strong>angry</strong>. They have <i>claimed</i> this planet. <i>Today, today, today</i>, they whisper to their brothers, to their sisters. The swarm <i>shivers</i> in anticipation. They click, they chitter, they <strong>burst</strong>. <i>Today, today, today</i>. They move as a river, a steady stream, towards the camp of the walking machines. In unison they chant: <strong>we kill, we kill, we kill</strong>. <br><br>Will you stop them? </p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3052730/extras/12bc66430051cbec07afe512a4d46c81.avif?t=1755840284\" width=614 height=60 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3052730/extras/9ed48293bd02ba97a6335c807b5860bf.poster.avif?t=1755840284\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3052730/extras/9ed48293bd02ba97a6335c807b5860bf.webm?t=1755840284\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3052730/extras/9ed48293bd02ba97a6335c807b5860bf.mp4?t=1755840284\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Managing your settlement is <i>crucial</i> in <strong>Here Comes The Swarm</strong>. Gather enough resources for upgrades and expansion while keeping your population <i>fed and happy</i>. Make sure your defenses are <st